{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "1b9977be-70cf-4dbd-8af1-1459596b6527"/*NGonMesh*/,
  "Description": "Generates a flat regular polygon or disc mesh with a shared center vertex.\n\nIt can be rendered with [DrawMesh], [DrawMeshUnlit], [DrawMeshHatched] and others, or used as a source for points with [MeshVerticesToPoints] or [PointsOnMesh]. To import meshes from other programs use [LoadObj].\n\nAKA: circle, disc, polygon\n\nSee also: [CylinderMesh], [QuadMesh]\n\nAlso check out the [HowToDrawThings] tutorial.",
