        "Y": 224.66893
      },
      "Description": "How UVs are mapped.\n\nPlanar: projects the texture onto the disc.\nCircular: U follows the angle, V goes from the center (0) to the edge (1).\nCircularScaled: like Circular, but V at the edge equals the radius.",
